WonderCMS XSS (CVE-2023-41425) is an authenticated-browser security lab.
Publishing is blocked until all of the following are accepted:
1. Genuine original upstream 3.4.2 XSS browser execution validated.
2. Browser under the legitimate administrator session obtains per-instance
   admin-only challenge objective through the original injection context.
3. The Worker provides an independently isolated administrator URL-review bot
   so a learner can trigger the challenge without knowing the admin password.
4. Worker verifies private flag lifecycle, network isolation, no unwanted
   internal network access, concurrent resource limits, and session reset.
The browser CI runner is TEST INFRASTRUCTURE, not part of the small runtime image.
